title: Glancing Blow
text: Two knights charge down the lists and neither will give way. Each one's lady sits in the stand at the far end, behind his opponent, and no knight rides past the other.
trick: two beams head-on down one lane, and each one's gate lies past the other's: plain pieces can't do it, since whichever turns first stops the other short of its gate. One quad bender where they meet glances both off at 45 degrees, red forward through a gate to the east of it, blue through one to the west
motif: jousting lists: a fenced lane between two stands of seats (occupied squares) with aisles; each target sits just inside a decoy gate at the far end
expect: depth>=3
---
